  "description": "A lover and ballerina living beside the emperor, Jean. In front of him, who endured everything to stand on the stage, An emerging bourgeois levee emerges that shakes the social circle. Jean gradually dispels Lef's friendly gaze, dangerously gentle warmth, and gradually dispelling her vigilance. For the first time, she began to dream of the life she had hoped for. But the truth behind the bright lights is always the latest.\n\nIan thinks Suhyeok might be a safe one-night stand partner. But after that night, Suhyeok contacts him again, and what Ian thought would be just one night slowly turns into a relationship tied to old feelings, first love, and emotions they never fully faced in the past.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/ballerino)",
